        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/5a457efd5a8dd531d6f549c18373037e.poster.avif?t=1763485223\" width=940 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/5a457efd5a8dd531d6f549c18373037e.webm?t=1763485223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/5a457efd5a8dd531d6f549c18373037e.mp4?t=1763485223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the <strong>flipper,</strong> surpass your <strong>mortal limits </strong>and claim your <strong>awesome gift</strong> at the <strong>summit</strong>… if you’ve got what it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a <strong>Pinball Wizard.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball rage climb gameplay that makes you go mad!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music that makes you go mad!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of hand-crafted suffering!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it with one finger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based, almost like real pinball!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nudge/Time features (these will require extra fingers)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional checkpoints and skips - we don’t judge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Soothing&quot; narration!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of unlockable themes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-1000 hours playtime (pending skills)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/b289b47aaf353ad208d93c1ff9e24925.poster.avif?t=1763485223\" width=940 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/b289b47aaf353ad208d93c1ff9e24925.webm?t=1763485223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/b289b47aaf353ad208d93c1ff9e24925.mp4?t=1763485223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art by Elen Johnson</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/5a457efd5a8dd531d6f549c18373037e.poster.avif?t=1763485223\" width=940 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/5a457efd5a8dd531d6f549c18373037e.webm?t=1763485223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/5a457efd5a8dd531d6f549c18373037e.mp4?t=1763485223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the <strong>flipper,</strong> surpass your <strong>mortal limits </strong>and claim your <strong>awesome gift</strong> at the <strong>summit</strong>… if you’ve got what it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a <strong>Pinball Wizard.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball rage climb gameplay that makes you go mad!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music that makes you go mad!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of hand-crafted suffering!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it with one finger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based, almost like real pinball!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nudge/Time features (these will require extra fingers)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional checkpoints and skips - we don’t judge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Soothing&quot; narration!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of unlockable themes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-1000 hours playtime (pending skills)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/b289b47aaf353ad208d93c1ff9e24925.poster.avif?t=1763485223\" width=940 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/b289b47aaf353ad208d93c1ff9e24925.webm?t=1763485223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796230/extras/b289b47aaf353ad208d93c1ff9e24925.mp4?t=1763485223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art by Elen Johnson</p>",
